If you have fun this way, try to keep it up. Buy major consultations from
the Oracle to get more information about the game. The Oracle appears in
every game early on, and her advice is well worth the money.

It depends on individual taste what information is thought to spoil the
game. Personally, I read spoilers or the source code whenever I am in
doubt about the game mechanics, and still NetHack is unspoilt for me.

> I'm wondering though if
