Most people who read this newsgroup also regularly read spoilers; you
can hardly get more spoiled than by reading rgrn. If you ask a question
and wish to receive only a hint and not a detailed answer, you should
explicitly state so; otherwise you will get a complete, but possibly
spoiling answer.

